      "lines": [
        "数（也就是$\\frac{b}{2}$是整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面，我们举几个利用公式（Б）解二次方程的例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1 解方程",
        "$7x^2-10x-8=0$.",
        "得到：",
        "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-5)^2-7\\cdot(-8)=81$，",
        "$x=\\frac{5\\pm\\sqrt{81}}{7}$，$x=-\\frac{4}{7}$或$x=2$.",
        "答：$\\left\\{-\\frac{4}{7},2\\right\\}$.",
        "我们发现，如果利用公式（A），就会使计算更加繁琐."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 解方程",
        "$4x^2-4x+5=0$.",
        "得到：",
        "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-2)^2-4\\times5=-16$.",
        "因为$\\frac{D}{4}<0$，所以$D<0$. 因此，这个二次方程没有根."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 解方程：",
        "а) $2x^2-5x-3=0$；　б) $3x^2-8x+5=0$；",
        "в) $5x^2+9x+4=0$；　г) $36x^2-12x+1=0$；",
        "д) $3x^2-3x+1=0$；　е) $x^2+9x-22=0$；",
        "ж) $7x^2-11x-6=0$；　з) $x^2-12x+32=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
